+# Gaotus Mobility Passenger v0.6.7+28 — GPS-First Map Startup
+
+- Removes the visible London fallback from the Passenger home map.
+- Reads OS last-known GPS first for instant startup when available.
+- Requests a fresh high-accuracy GPS fix immediately after and recenters only when needed.
+- Does not create the tile map until a real cached/current GPS position exists, so no irrelevant London tiles are downloaded.
+- First install / no cached GPS shows a neutral locating state with Retry instead of a false map location.
+- Nearby-car lookup waits until a real location exists.
+- Notification, Firebase, realtime, booking and chat code are unchanged by this delta.
